                    gen "(chuckling) So you turned yourself into an ice statue... while standing in your underwear, arms stretched out?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                    lun "Exactly. I was basically a very inappropriate store mannequin." ("base", "narrow", "base", "mid") # Thoughtful, expressing mild amusement and embarrassment.
