                    lun @ cheeks blush "Thankfully, the shopkeeper thawed me out after they got the Demiguise under control. But the damage was done. The customer left in stunned silence." ("soft", "narrow", "base", "downR") # Normal Embarrassed, expressing lingering embarrassment.
                    gen "At least tell me you got your clothes back?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                    lun "Oh, yes. Once the Demiguise was captured, everything it had taken reappeared. But, by then, the embarrassment was permanent." ("base", "narrow", "base", "mid") # Thoughtful, expressing mild relief and lingering embarrassment.
                    gen "Well, look on the bright side—you provided a very unique shopping experience." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                    lun "(grinning weakly) Great. Next time I’ll charge extra for the live performance." ("base", "narrow", "base", "mid") # Thoughtful, attempting to deflect with humor.
                elif dialogue_label == "Fire Crab's Fiery Fiasco":
                    # "Fire Crab's Fiery Fiasco"
                    lun "I... I was taking care of the Fire Crabs at *Magical Menagerie* today." ("base", "narrow", "base", "mid") # Thoughtful, expressing mild concern.
                    lun "It started off fine, but then things got... *heated*." ("base", "narrow", "base", "mid") # Thoughtful, expressing mild concern with a pun.
                    gen "Heated? You mean, they actually set something on fire?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
