                    gen "So now you’re just *drenched* and stuck in *wet clothes*? I’m starting to think you’re living in a magical disaster." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                    lun "(grimacing, tugging at her blouse) Yes, and it’s not just wet. It’s now *transparent* from all the water, which made me realize—well, everyone could see a bit more than they probably should have." ("base", "narrow", "base", "mid") # Thoughtful, expressing mild dismay and embarrassment.
                    gen "(eyes widening) Wait, wait—*transparent*? You mean—" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                    lun "(fidgeting) Yes, my blouse is practically *sticking* to me now, and let’s just say... well, *everyone* in the shop can now see a lot more of me than I had planned to share." ("base", "narrow", "base", "mid") # Thoughtful, expressing embarrassment.
                    gen "(groans) Oh, great. So, not only were you fighting fire, you ended up giving the customers a *show*." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                    lun "(shrugs) It wasn’t my intention, but... I guess it’s a *lesson* learned." ("base", "narrow", "base", "mid") # Thoughtful, expressing mild resignation.
                    gen "(snickers) A lesson in *keeping your distance* from fire-breathing creatures, right?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                    lun @ cheeks blush "Exactly. And now I’m stuck with this *wet* situation." ("soft", "narrow", "base", "downR") # Normal Embarrassed, expressing embarrassment.
