                    lun @ cheeks blush "(muttering, half-smiling) Could you give me a *discount* for the free show I’m giving?" ("soft", "narrow", "base", "downR") # Normal Embarrassed, attempting to deflect with humor.
                    gen "(smirking) I’d say *no*—but I’ve already seen enough. I’ll consider it a *special* discount for surviving the chaos." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                    lun @ cheeks blush "A *special* discount for me, huh? That’s the first time anyone’s given me a reward for being drenched and practically naked!" ("soft", "narrow", "base", "downR") # Normal Embarrassed, expressing mild amusement and embarrassment.
                    gen "I think you’re *earning* that discount in more ways than one..." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
