                    gen "Let’s hope so, for everyone’s sake." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                    lun "Here’s the payment. Just... don't mind the wet blouse." ("soft", "narrow", "base", "downR") # Normal Embarrassed, expressing mild embarrassment.                 
