                            lun "Yeah, great. I won. Except I had to *swim* all the way back, *topless*, while dodging grindylows that suddenly found me *very* interesting." ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "Oh. Extra challenge mode." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Playful, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun "Then, once I got out, I had to sneak past a group of first-years, and *that* is how I learned that kelp is a terrible substitute for clothing." ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "For future reference." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Playful, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun "And *then*, Peeves showed up." ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "Oh no." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                            lun "Oh *yes.* He threw *ink balloons*. Do you know how hard it is to stay hidden when you’re *covered in black splotches*?!" ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "Yeah, that’s what we call ‘maximum exposure.’" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Playful, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun "I ran. I ran *so fast*. Right past a group of Ravenclaws, who will *absolutely* be writing about this in their journals tonight." ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "Sounds like you're going down in history." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Playful, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun "*I don’t want to be in history!*" ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            lun "Anyway. Here’s your payment. At least *this* didn’t get washed away." ("base", "narrow", "base", "mid") # Thoughtful, expressing mild concern.
                            lun "I *hate* this." ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "Want me to—?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                            lun "*No!* I’ll figure it out!" ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            lun "That counts as ‘delivered,’ right?" ("base", "narrow", "base", "mid") # Thoughtful, expressing mild concern.
                            gen "I’ll allow it." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Amused, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun "Alright. I need a shower. And a *robe*. And maybe therapy." ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "And a new bikini." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Playful, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun "And a *new lake*." ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "Next time, maybe bring an anchor?" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Playful, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun "Next time, I’m bringing *revenge*." ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            lun "Here’s the payment. I’m glad that’s over." ("base", "base", "base", "mid") # Neutral, expressing relief.
                        block:
                            # $ luna.strip("bra")
                            # $ luna.strip("panties")
                            $ luna.set_pose("hand_on_pussy_and_breast")
                            lun "I cleaned the Black Lake... again." ("base", "narrow", "base", "mid") # Thoughtful, expressing mild concern.
                            gen "Oh no... What happened *this* time?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                            lun "EVERYTHING went wrong. It started off simple—I was skimming algae, dodging grindylows... and then a group of wizard fishermen showed up!" ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "Fishermen? In the Black Lake? That’s a new one." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                            lun "Oh, they weren’t *just* fishing. They were enchanted. Mesmerized. Because SOMEONE—ME—was the only thing in sight wearing a *microbikini*!" ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "Wait... are you telling me they stopped fishing to watch you clean the lake?" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Shocked, expressing disbelief.
                            lun "Oh, it gets WORSE. The mermaids noticed too. They swam over, started cheering me on, calling me ‘The Lake’s Siren’." ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "Well, at least you had a fan club?" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Playful, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun @ cheeks blush "NO! Because while the mermaids were clapping, the GIANT SQUID decided to get ‘helpful’ again!" ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion and embarrassment.
                            gen "Oh, this should be good." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Amused, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun @ cheeks blush "It *wasn’t*! The squid thought my bikini top was a *fish*! It grabbed it and just—RIPPED IT OFF!" ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion and embarrassment.
                            gen "PFFT—" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Amused, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun @ cheeks blush "And as I was trying to grab it back, a sudden magical current swept through the lake! Guess what it took with it?" ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion and embarrassment.
                            gen "Oh no..." ("angry", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Shocked, expressing disbelief.
                            lun @ cheeks blush "OH YES. It stole my bottom! So there I am, underwater, NAKED, covering myself with my hands while an entire crowd of mermaids and fishermen start *cheering*!" ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion and embarrassment.
                            gen "So... let me get this straight. You lost your bikini top to the squid, your bottom to the current, and now you’ve got an audience?" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Amused, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun @ cheeks blush "And THEN, instead of helping me, the mermaids *crowned me their lake queen* and draped seaweed over me like it was some fancy royal attire!" ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion and embarrassment.
                            gen "Oh, that’s *amazing*." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Amused, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun @ cheeks blush "And the fishermen? They thought it was some kind of grand finale. They started *clapping*, tossing me coins, and one of them handed me an amulet—‘for my bravery’!" ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion and embarrassment.
                            gen "Well, at least you got paid *and* got a fancy souvenir!" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Amused, expressing lightheartedness.
                            lun "THERE. Take it. I’m going to go *burn* this memory from my brain." ("angry", "closed", "base", "mid") # Angry, expressing strong negative emotion.
                            gen "You know... next time, we should *charge admission*." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Playful, expressing lightheartedness.
                            gen "See? Even *you* think it’s funny now!" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Amused, expressing lightheartedness.
                            # *Luna shakes her head, still laughing as she exits the room, leaving a trail of water and algae behind.*
            "-Dismiss her-":
                gen "Great, then that will be all for now." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
                gen "Your contribution are updated.." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")

    gen "Good job, [name_luna_genie]." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
    lun "Thank you, [name_genie_luna]." ("base", "base", "base", "mid")
    nar "You receive {number=payment} gold coins."

    $ game.gold += payment

    call lun_walk(action="leave")

    $ luna.equip(lun_outfit_last)
    $ luna.set_pose("default")
    $ states.lun.busy = True
    $ current_job = None

    jump main_room_menu